[{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0650","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0650.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21188","title":"Microsoft Azure Network Watcher VM 扩展特权提升漏洞","description":"Azure Network Watcher VM 扩展存在权限提升漏洞（CWE-59：链接解析不当），具有高权限的本地攻击者可通过创建恶意符号链接诱导扩展组件错误地解析文件路径，从而以更高权限覆盖或删除系统文件，导致系统完整性和可用性受损。该漏洞需攻击者已获得目标虚拟机的高权限访问权限方可利用，攻击复杂度低，无需用户交互。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 2 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.0,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21188"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-11T18:15:30Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:42:43Z","remediation":"立即将 Azure Network Watcher VM Extension 升级到 1.4.3563.1 或更高版本。可通过 Azure 门户中虚拟机扩展管理或使用 Azure CLI 命令 `az vm extension set --vm-name <VM名称> --resource-group <资源组> --name AzureNetworkWatcherExtension --publisher Microsoft.Azure.NetworkWatcher --version 1.4.3563.1` 完成更新。如无法立即升级，可限制对 VM 扩展具有高权限（Contributor 及以上）的账户数量，并审计扩展操作日志以降低被利用风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21188","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/03dbfc069b6c638678ff904c80e89aaf72b93764/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21188.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1fe56a0dafbbcb548bdcdd4fc990cca72ac81c28/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21188.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2d66b7c0b89f8bfe02ef8d342b4bf0a1bab5ffd1/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21188.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2d66b7c0b89f8bfe02ef8d342b4bf0a1bab5ffd1/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21188.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21188.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21188.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/0d2adc4a9428696b559622523817d9cdfdad97f0/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-211xx/CVE-2025-21188.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/b258f1790af19a85ccc98f5e771360cd7a4cb4d7/2025/CVE-2025-21188.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/ef57640f19da1737a8612e28839821eee8a753b5/api/2025/CVE-2025-21188.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2025-21188"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0650.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0646","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0646.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21184","title":"Microsoft Windows Core Messaging 特权提升漏洞","description":"Windows Core Messaging 组件存在堆缓冲区溢出漏洞，该漏洞源于对内存对象处理不当。已获得低权限的本地攻击者可通过精心构造的应用程序调用受影响组件接口触发堆缓冲区溢出，从而将权限提升至 SYSTEM 级别，实现完全控制目标系统。该漏洞攻击复杂度较高，但无需用户交互即可利用。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 2 月安全更新（5051974）中修复此漏洞，影响多个 Windows 版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.0,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21184"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-11T18:15:30Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:42:43Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2025 年 2 月安全更新。Windows 10 22H2/21H2 升级至 OS Build 19045.5487/19044.5487（KB5051974）；Windows 11 22H2/23H2 升级至 OS Build 22621.4890/22631.4890；Windows 11 24H2 升级至 OS Build 26100.3194；Windows Server 2025 升级至 OS Build 26100.3194。可通过 Windows Update 自动更新或访问 Microsoft 更新目录手动下载。该漏洞需本地低权限用户交互且攻击复杂度高，如无法立即打补丁，建议限制非授权用户对系统的本地访问权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21184","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/03dbfc069b6c638678ff904c80e89aaf72b93764/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21184.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1fe56a0dafbbcb548bdcdd4fc990cca72ac81c28/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21184.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03a7e425813b5ae0ce33712378801e4e929dbdb7/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21184.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03a7e425813b5ae0ce33712378801e4e929dbdb7/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21184.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21184.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21184.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/2720049fa2ff0728cf5af8a5d5207201a53780f6/2025/CVE-2025-21184.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/0d2adc4a9428696b559622523817d9cdfdad97f0/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-211xx/CVE-2025-21184.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2025-21184","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21184.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0646.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0645","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0645.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21183","title":"Microsoft Windows ReFS 重复数据删除服务特权提升漏洞","description":"Windows 复原文件系统（ReFS）重复数据删除服务存在双重释放（Double Free）内存损坏漏洞，属于权限提升漏洞。本地攻击者无需任何权限即可在满足特定条件的情况下触发该漏洞，成功利用后可获取系统最高权限（SYSTEM），从而完全控制目标主机，窃取敏感数据、安装恶意程序或创建管理员账户。该漏洞影响多个 Windows Server 及桌面版本，CVSS 评分 7.4，危害等级高危。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 2 月安全更新（KB5051987）中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.4,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21183"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-11T18:15:29Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:42:43Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2025 年 2 月安全更新 KB5051987（Windows 11 24H2 升级至 OS Build 26100.3194，Windows Server 2025 升级至 10.0.26100.3194），或通过 Windows Update 自动获取更新。Server Core 安装版本同样适用此补丁。如无法立即打补丁，可考虑禁用 ReFS 重复数据删除服务（Dedup 服务）作为临时缓解措施，但需评估对存储效率的影响。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21183","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/03dbfc069b6c638678ff904c80e89aaf72b93764/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21183.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1fe56a0dafbbcb548bdcdd4fc990cca72ac81c28/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21183.json","https