,"collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21182","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/03dbfc069b6c638678ff904c80e89aaf72b93764/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21182.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1fe56a0dafbbcb548bdcdd4fc990cca72ac81c28/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21182.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03a7e425813b5ae0ce33712378801e4e929dbdb7/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21182.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03a7e425813b5ae0ce33712378801e4e929dbdb7/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21182.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21182.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21182.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b9f52bb052695dac5cabbd58e049eaac73697161/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-211xx/CVE-2025-21182.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/bc6988a2a044e68837754c12506c5490595b4bd3/2025/CVE-2025-21182.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/ef57640f19da1737a8612e28839821eee8a753b5/api/2025/CVE-2025-21182.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2025-21182"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0644.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0643","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0643.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21181","title":"Microsoft 消息队列 (MSMQ) 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Microsoft Message Queuing (MSMQ) 存在资源消耗漏洞（CWE-400），未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过网络向目标系统发送特制的 MSMQ 消息触发该漏洞，导致 MSMQ 服务消耗大量系统资源而崩溃或停止响应，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Windows 10/11 及 Windows Server 等多个版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 2 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21181"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-11T18:15:29Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:42:42Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2025 年 2 月安全更新 (KB5051974)，可通过 Windows Update 自动获取或从 Microsoft 更新目录手动下载。受影响版本包括 Windows 10/11 及 Windows Server 2008~2025 全系列，更新后 MSMQ 组件版本将升级至对应修复版本（如 Windows 11 24H2 需升级至 10.0.26100.3194 以上）。如无法立即打补丁，可在不需要 MSMQ 服务的系统上通过「控制面板 → 程序和功能 → 启用或关闭 Windows 功能」禁用 Microsoft Message Queuing (MSMQ) 服务，或在防火墙层面限制 1801/TCP 端口的入站流量作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21181","https://www.vicarius.io/vsociety/posts/cve-2025-21181-denial-of-service-vulnerability-in-microsoft-message-queuing-detection-script","https://www.vicarius.io/vsociety/posts/cve-2025-21181-denial-of-service-vulnerability-in-microsoft-message-queuing-mitigation-script","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2025/CVE-2025-21181.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/986b45a0ac2dd215b3a5515fba0cebac769043dd/2025/CVE-2025-21181.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/03dbfc069b6c638678ff904c80e89aaf72b93764/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21181.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1fe56a0dafbbcb548bdcdd4fc990cca72ac81c28/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21181.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03a7e425813b5ae0ce33712378801e4e929dbdb7/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21181.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03a7e425813b5ae0ce33712378801e4e929dbdb7/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21181.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2025/CVE-2025-21181.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21181.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21181.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/bc6988a2a044e68837754c12506c5490595b4bd3/2025/CVE-2025-21181.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0643.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0641","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0641.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21179","title":"Microsoft DHCP 客户端服务拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Windows DHCP 客户端服务存在越界读取漏洞。由于 DHCP 客户端服务在处理特制 DHCP 响应报文时未正确验证数据边界，导致越界内存读取，进而触发服务崩溃。该漏洞的攻击复杂度较高，需要攻击者与目标处于同一相邻网络，并诱使用户触发特定网络操作。成功利用此漏洞可导致 DHCP 客户端服务停止响应，造成拒绝服务。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 2 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21179"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-11T18:15:29Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:42:42Z","remediation":"建议立即安装 Microsoft 2025 年 2 月安全更新：Windows 11 24H2 安装 KB5051987（OS Build 26100.3194），Windows 11 23H2/22H2 安装 KB5051989（OS Build 22631.4890），Windows Server 系统安装对应版本的安全更新或热补丁 KB5052105。可通过 Windows Update 自动获取更新，或从 Microsoft Update Catalog 手动下载安装。如无法立即打补丁，可在网络层面限制 DHCP 端口的相邻网络访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21179","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/03dbfc069b6c638678ff904c80e89aaf72b93764/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21179.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1fe56a0dafbbcb548bdcdd4fc990cca72ac81c28/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21179.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03a7e425813b5ae0ce33712378801e4e929dbdb7/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21179.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03a7e425813b5ae0ce33712378801e4e929dbdb7/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21179.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21179.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21179.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b9f52bb052695dac5cabbd58e049eaac73697161/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-211xx/CVE-2025-21179.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/bc6988a2a044e68837754c