PoC 利用代码。远程攻击者可利用特制的二进制文件触发该漏洞，导致目标系统上的应用程序崩溃或潜在的内存数据破坏。该漏洞影响 GNU Binutils 2.43 版本，CVSS 评分 6.3，危害等级中危。补丁提交为 75086e9de1707281172cc77f178e7949a4414ed0，建议用户及时更新至修复版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.3,"aliases":["CVE-2025-1178"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-11T07:15:29Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:38:32Z","remediation":"立即应用补丁提交 75086e9de1707281172cc77f178e7949a4414ed0，将 GNU Binutils 升级至 2.45 或更高版本。SUSE 用户可参考 SUSE-SU-2025:4096-1 安全公告执行系统更新，NetApp 用户参考 ntap-20250411-0008 公告进行修复。如无法立即更新，建议限制对 ld 组件的远程访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://sourceware.org/bugzilla/attachment.cgi?id=15914","https://sourceware.org/bugzilla/show_bug.cgi?id=32638","https://sourceware.org/git/gitweb.cgi?p=binutils-gdb.git;h=75086e9de1707281172cc77f178e7949a4414ed0","https://vuldb.com/?ctiid.295081","https://vuldb.com/?id.295081","https://vuldb.com/?submit.495369","https://www.gnu.org/","https://security.netapp.com/advisory/ntap-20250411-0008/","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2025/CVE-2025-1178.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/b6e8cb5bd39fed494b7be90b0ffddcadd3893758/2025/CVE-2025-1178.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/487ea3f21ed49470634e758e1f8f2ac74b64d6b0/cves/2025/1xxx/CVE-2025-1178.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/0d5eda5cdae3f3a50b92fdfcae2f5983174f2a99/2025/1xxx/CVE-2025-1178.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6052148b71cb79d42fd4a59f87982387b0487834/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-1178.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/1c2e0105dfc8043b137c91cc2d5ac23317d19c53/pocs/2025/CVE-2025-1178.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6052148b71cb79d42fd4a59f87982387b0487834/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-1178.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2025/CVE-2025-1178.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/9e840c51f12aff4a18b8c50d63ae898b6e33f403/references/CVE-2025-1178-2025-04-11-2105","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-1178.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0481.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0480","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0480.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-1176","title":"GNU Binutils ld 堆缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"GNU Binutils 2.43 的 ld 组件在处理 ELF 文件链接时，elflink.c 文件中的 _bfd_elf_gc_mark_rsec 函数存在堆缓冲区溢出漏洞。攻击者可通过向目标系统提供特制的 ELF 对象文件触发该漏洞，导致堆内存越界写入。该漏洞可被远程触发（如通过诱导用户链接恶意文件），但攻击复杂度较高。成功利用可能导致程序崩溃或潜在的内存破坏。GNU Binutils 项目已通过提交 f9978defb6fab0bd8583942d97c112b0932ac814 修复此问题，建议用户及时应用补丁或更新至修复版本。","severity":"LOW","score":2.3,"aliases":["CVE-2025-1176"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-11T06:15:22Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:38:31Z","remediation":"立即将 GNU Binutils 升级至 2.44 或更高版本，该版本已包含针对 `_bfd_elf_gc_mark_rsec` 堆溢出的修复补丁（commit f9978defb6fab0bd8583942d97c112b0932ac814）。SUSE 用户可安装 SUSE-SU-2025:4096-1 安全更新。临时缓解措施：在 aarch64 架构上避免使用 `-z gcs=implicit` 链接器选项。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://sourceware.org/bugzilla/attachment.cgi?id=15913","https://sourceware.org/bugzilla/show_bug.cgi?id=32636","https://sourceware.org/git/gitweb.cgi?p=binutils-gdb.git;h=f9978defb6fab0bd8583942d97c112b0932ac814","https://vuldb.com/?ctiid.295079","https://vuldb.com/?id.295079","https://vuldb.com/?submit.495329","https://www.gnu.org/","https://security.netapp.com/advisory/ntap-20250411-0007/","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2025/CVE-2025-1176.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/b6e8cb5bd39fed494b7be90b0ffddcadd3893758/2025/CVE-2025-1176.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/487ea3f21ed49470634e758e1f8f2ac74b64d6b0/cves/2025/1xxx/CVE-2025-1176.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/0d5eda5cdae3f3a50b92fdfcae2f5983174f2a99/2025/1xxx/CVE-2025-1176.json","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2025/CVE-2025-11762.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6052148b71cb79d42fd4a59f87982387b0487834/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-1176.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/1c2e0105dfc8043b137c91cc2d5ac23317d19c53/pocs/2025/CVE-2025-1176.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6052148b71cb79d42fd4a59f87982387b0487834/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-1176.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2025/CVE-2025-1176.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/9e840c51f12aff4a18b8c50d63ae898b6e33f403/references/CVE-2025-1176-2025-04-11-2105"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0480.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0502","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0502.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-1211","title":"Hackney hackney 服务器端请求伪造（SSRF）漏洞","description":"Hackney 包（Erlang HTTP 客户端库）1.21.0 之前版本存在服务器端请求伪造（SSRF）漏洞。漏洞根源在于 URI 内置模块与 hackney 对 URL 的解析不一致：URI 模块正确解析 `http://127.0.0.1?@127.2.2.2/` 的主机为 127.0.0.1，但 hackney 错误地将主机识别为 127.2.2.2/。攻击者可利用此差异构造特制 URL，绕过基于 URI 函数的主机检查机制，诱使服务端向内部网络发起请求，可能导致敏感信息泄露或内网探测。该漏洞影响所有使用 hackney 且依赖 URI 函数进行主机校验的 Erlang 应用，CVSS 评分 2.9，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":2.9,"aliases":["CVE-2025-1211"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-11T05:15:14Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:38:36Z","remediation":"将 hackney 升级至 1.21.0 或更高版本（`mix deps.update hackney` 或更新 `rebar.lock` 中 hackney 版本约束）。如无法立即升级，在调用 hackney 前自行对 URL 进行二次解析校验，确保 URI.parse/1 与 hackney 实际请求的目标主机一致，避免依赖单一 URL 解析结果做安全判断。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://gist.github.com/snoopysecurity/996de09ec0cfd0ebdcfdda8ff515deb1","https://github.com/benoitc/hackney/commit/9594ce58fabd32cd897fc28fae937694515a3d4a","https://security.snyk.io/vuln/SNYK-HEX-HACKNEY-6516131","https://www.blackhat.com/docs/us-17/thursday/us-17-Tsai-A-New-Era-Of-SSRF-Exploiting-URL-Parser-In-Trending-Programming-Languages.pdf","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2025/CVE-2025-1211.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/95e02b73a69df169404c6b2708e1f8d0346744bc/cves/2025/1xxx/CVE-2025-1211.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/95f29039d9df9f64ea752bc1ef04de2ad5981e05/2025/1xxx/CVE-2025-1211.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a5deeab9684d7cc5d59192453c93e2b5d43622a9/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-1211.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/1c2e0105dfc8043b137c91cc2d5ac23317d19c53/pocs/2025/CVE-2025-1211.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a5deeab9684d7cc5d59192453c93e2b5d43622a9/GHSA/data/2025/CVE-2025-1211.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a5deeab9684d7cc5d59192453c93e2b5d43622a9/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-1211.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-1211.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2025-1211.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2025/CVE-2025-1211.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0502.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0806","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0806.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21347","title":"Microsoft Windows 部署服务拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Windows 部署服务（WDS）存在不当链接解析漏洞（CWE-59），由于服务在处理文件路径时未能正确验证符号链接，本地攻击者可通过诱导已登录用户访问恶意构造的符号链接文件，触发服务对目标文件的不当访问，导致服务进程崩溃或资源耗尽，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞攻击复杂度较高，需要低权限和用户交互，影响 Windows 10/11 全系列及 Windows Server 2012/2016/2019/2022/2025 等多个版本。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 2 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21347"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-11T00:00:00Z","updated":"2025-02-11T00:00:00Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2025 年 2 月安全更新（KB5051974），可通过 Windows Update 自动获取或从 Microsoft 更新目录手动下载。此更新修复了 Windows 部署服务（WDS）中因不当处理链接文件导致的拒绝服务漏洞。如无法立即打补丁，建议在不需要 WDS 的服务器上禁用 Windows 部署服务（通过服务管理器停止 WDSService），或在防火墙层面限制对 WDS 端口（UDP 67/68、TCP 135/445）的访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/0950a261126c1029f51ef04a190f1baacd16eb08/2025/CVE-2025-21347.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/7b5ce0c8ddaaec75eae1da91b247176dbec670ba/2025/CVE-2025-21347.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a0edea60322bafbed67887cf7a4d97a55df8a9fa/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21347.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/66d1812e8a3da670e7f0e03b721b33c3bf9d2035/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21347.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e6d30197c1ae0e0b416414f6f0ed16544575a73f/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21347.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e6d30197c1ae0e0b416414f6f0ed16544575a73f/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21347.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2025/CVE-2025-21347.md","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/63ad67a97b34adc6ff5f668eaf85b5dbf28137e8/2025/CVE-2025-21347/README.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21347.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/63ad67a97b34adc6ff5f668eaf85b5dbf28137e8/2025/CVE-2025-21347/poc.py"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0806.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0482","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0482.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-1179","title":"GNU Binutils ld 内存损坏漏洞","description":"GNU Binutils 2.43 版本的 ld 组件中 bfd/libbfd.c 文件的 bfd_putl64 函数存在内存损坏漏洞（CWE-119）。攻击者可通过构造特制的二进制文件，在链接处理过程中触发越界内存操作，导致程序崩溃或潜在代码执行。该漏洞攻击复杂度较高，远程攻击者需诱导用户处理恶意文件方可利用。GNU Binutils 2.44 版本已修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2025-1179"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-11T00:00:00Z","updated":"2025-02-11T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 GNU Binutils 至 2.44 或更高版本，该漏洞已在 2.43 至 2.44 之间被修复。SUSE 用户请应用 SUSE-SU-2025:4096-1 安全更新。在 aarch64 架构上不要对旧代码流启用 '-z gcs=implicit' 链接选项作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2025/CVE-2025-1179.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/b6e8cb5bd39fed494b7be90b0ffddcadd3893758/2025/CVE-2025-1179.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/93bf7691fc17bf58197ad166ee362b4808566d7c/cves/2025/1xxx/CVE-2025-1179.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/0d5eda5cdae3f3a50b92fdfcae2f5983174f2a99/2025/1xxx/CVE-2025-1179.json","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2025/CVE-2025-11794.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6052148b71cb79d42fd4a59f87982387b0487834/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-1179.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/1c2e0105dfc8043b137c91cc2d5ac23317d19c53/pocs/2025/CVE-2025-1179.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6052148b71cb79d42fd4a59f87982387b0487834/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-1179.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2025/CVE-2025-1179.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-1179.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0482.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0022","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0022.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-24016","title":"Wazuh Wazuh服务器反序列化远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Wazuh 4.4.0 至 4.9.0 版本中存在不安全反序列化漏洞（CWE-502）。攻击者通过 API 向 DistributedAPI 请求/响应注入恶意字典，利用 `as_wazuh_object` 函数在处理 `__unhandled_exc__` 时执行任意 Python 代码，导致远程代码执行。任何具备 API 访问权限的用户（包括被攻破的仪表盘、集群内 Wazuh 服务器，特定配置下甚至被攻破的 Agent）均可触发。CVSS 9.9，危害严重。厂商已在 4.9.1 版本中修复。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.9,"aliases":["CVE-2025-24016"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2025-02-10T20:15:42Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:57:53Z","remediation":"立即升级 Wazuh 服务器至 v4.9.1 或更高版本，该版本在 `framework/wazuh/core/cluster/common.py` 中修复了 `as_wazuh_object` 反序列化函数对不可信输入的校验缺陷。在升级前，可在 Wazuh  dashboard 和集群节点间启用严格 API 访问控制（限制 `security/user/authenticate/run_as` 端点的来源 IP），并隔离受损 agent 避免其触发 DAPI 请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/wazuh/wazuh/security/advisories/GHSA-hcrc-79hj-m3qh","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2025-24016","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2025/CVE-2025-24016.yaml","https://github.com/celsius026/poc_CVE-2025-24016","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b4f1378756fd26f414d09a97dc81126672830951/2025/CVE-2025-24016.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/c2672e36893bd220d6f65c955e260796d11ed64b/2025/CVE-2025-24016.json","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/010b0aa4fab18a47a1dfa699acc027ecfea23b55/http/cves/2025/CVE-2025-24016.yaml","https://github.com/rapid7/metasploit-framework/blob/fcd24bcde44c83907fc2e965d2d0edd0cb92051b/modules/exploits/linux/http/wazuh_auth_rce_cve_2025_24016.rb","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/c82e1e98119c564b0325f2c203e3475b09c90003/data/2025/CVE-2025-24016-0xjessie21_CVE-2025-24016.md","https://github.com/rix4uni/cvemapping/blob/aaa966adf56b88bf2eba7f47ee24a777c6208719/2025/CVE-2025-24016/README.md","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2025/CVE-2025-24016.rules","https://github.com/0xjessie21/CVE-2025-24016/blob/02118546f7a4361e8136cc5ac7079eced88fd646/CVE-2025-24016.py","https://github.c